OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed wife 78 times
OL,4,Ajailed for 18 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered his wife by stabbing
OL,7,Fher at least 78 times has been jailed
OL,8,Ffor a minimum of 18 years and 298 days.
OL,10,FRobert Alexander was married to nurse
OL,11,FChristina Alexander, 60, for about six
OL,12,Fyears, before he killed her at their
OL,13,Fhome in Tamworth, Staffordshire, on 23
OL,14,FJune 2025.
OL,16,FHe was found guilty of her murder by a
OL,17,Fjury in June and the prosecutors said
OL,18,Fhe had showed controlling and violent
OL,19,Fbehaviour throughout the relationship,
OL,20,Fwhich started after the couple met
OL,21,Fonline.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
