OL,3,GNEWSAMan who stabbed wife 78 times
OL,4,Ajailed for 18 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 66-year-old, of Ascot Drive,
OL,7,FTamworth, was told he would serve a
OL,8,Flife sentence by a judge at Stafford
OL,9,FCrown Court on Tuesday.
